WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:03.968
-All eyes are on the Manhattan
grand jury

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.968
as we await a possible
indictment of Donald Trump

00:00:05.968 --> 00:00:08.300
which would make him the first
president in American history

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.801
to face criminal charges.

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:11.400
Trump's allies
in the right-wing media

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.901
have been in hysterics
over the news,

00:00:12.901 --> 00:00:15.067
and Trump himself used
a rally this weekend

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:17.234
to attack the district attorney
investigating him.

00:00:17.234 --> 00:00:19.100
Trump also warned that if he's
arrested,

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.100
there will be
"death and destruction,"

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:24.100
which is, to use the words
of George Washington,

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.434
not cool, dude!

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:27.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:30.100
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:31.767 --> 00:00:33.767
♪♪

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:36.267
Okay, so, we were just on hiatus
for a week,

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:37.767
and the whole time,
I was stressed out

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:40.100
because when news breaks
while I'm on vacation,

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.934
no one else in my life
will listen to me.

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:46.100
My kids are the age where
if it's not about "Paw Patrol,"

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.601
they don't want
to [bleep] hear it.

00:00:48.601 --> 00:00:51.100
This show is my main,
my only outlet.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.300
When we're on break,
my only other option

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:54.968
for conversations about the news

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:56.801
is to call one of those
phone sex hotlines

00:00:56.801 --> 00:00:58.734
and tell them,
"No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:00:58.734 --> 00:01:00.634
I just want to talk about Trump
getting arrested."

00:01:00.634 --> 00:01:02.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:04.300
And then when it comes time
to pay for the phone sex line,

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.133
I use a check from
the appropriate bank account

00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:09.234
because I don't want to end up
like Donald Trump.

00:01:09.234 --> 00:01:11.567
Normally, hiatus is supposed
to be a vacation from the news,

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:13.567
but I spent the entire week
scrolling on my phone

00:01:13.567 --> 00:01:15.234
waiting to see a picture
of Trump getting hauled

00:01:15.234 --> 00:01:16.734
out of Mar-a-Lago in handcuffs,

00:01:16.734 --> 00:01:18.567
mainly because I think

00:01:18.567 --> 00:01:20.067
his arms are too inflexible

00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:22.200
to reach that far
behind his back.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.868 --> 00:01:27.701
That's why he always stands with
them straight down at his sides

00:01:27.701 --> 00:01:30.534
like a dollar-store G.I. Joe.

00:01:30.534 --> 00:01:32.033
It would be super funny

00:01:32.033 --> 00:01:34.200
to watch the cops
try to get the cuffs on him.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:35.467
"Alright, sir.

00:01:35.467 --> 00:01:36.701
Put your hands
behind your head."

00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:38.534
[As Trump] "Sorry, fellas,
they only go forward

00:01:38.534 --> 00:01:40.200
and out like this.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.000
This is the best
I can do for you."

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.334
[Normal voice]
They're gonna have...

00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:45.267
[ Laughter and applause ]
They're gonna have to get him

00:01:45.267 --> 00:01:48.434
a pair of Slinky handcuffs
he can wear

00:01:48.434 --> 00:01:50.434
while he's yelling at reporters.

00:01:50.434 --> 00:01:52.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.767
[As Trump] It's fun for a girl
and a boy!

00:01:57.767 --> 00:02:00.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.667 --> 00:02:02.000
[Normal voice]
But here we are.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.367
We're back, and once again,

00:02:03.367 --> 00:02:05.033
we're all on Trump
indictment watch.

00:02:05.033 --> 00:02:06.200
It could happen
at any moment,

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.868
or knowing Trump's luck,
maybe never.

00:02:07.868 --> 00:02:09.701
Somehow, Trump always escapes
accountability.

00:02:09.701 --> 00:02:11.067
At this point,
I wouldn't be surprised

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:13.234
if Merrick Garland
just put himself in jail.

00:02:13.234 --> 00:02:14.400
Merrick!

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.567
Merrick, why?!

00:02:15.567 --> 00:02:17.234
"I don't know, it just...

00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:18.901
It just seemed easier."

00:02:18.901 --> 00:02:20.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.100
Of course, the funniest
and worst timing

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.400
for Trump to be indicted

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.567
is between when we tape
this show in the afternoon

00:02:25.567 --> 00:02:29.567
and when we air at 12:37
or whatever ungodly hour it is.

00:02:29.567 --> 00:02:30.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.734 --> 00:02:32.067
If that happens, that means

00:02:32.067 --> 00:02:34.067
you're living in a very
different world than I am.

00:02:34.067 --> 00:02:35.734
How does it feel?
Is it satisfying?

00:02:35.734 --> 00:02:36.901
Or do you just feel empty?

00:02:36.901 --> 00:02:38.067
I'm worried
I'm gonna feel empty.

00:02:38.067 --> 00:02:39.400
Anyway...

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.434 --> 00:02:42.067
The grand jury
is still doing its work.

00:02:42.067 --> 00:02:43.567
In fact, they met
once again today.

00:02:43.567 --> 00:02:45.567
As far as we know
as of this taping,

00:02:45.567 --> 00:02:47.501
a Trump indictment
has not happened yet,

00:02:47.501 --> 00:02:49.434
but could come at any day now.

00:02:49.434 --> 00:02:51.901
-A grand jury is expected
to reconvene

00:02:51.901 --> 00:02:53.567
in Lower Manhattan
this morning

00:02:53.567 --> 00:02:56.901
on potential charges against
former President Donald Trump.

00:02:56.901 --> 00:02:58.734
-The grand jury here
is investigating

00:02:58.734 --> 00:03:00.968
former President Trump
and the hush-money payments

00:03:00.968 --> 00:03:02.467
that were made
to Stormy Daniels.

00:03:02.467 --> 00:03:04.801
That grand jury
is set to meet again today.

00:03:04.801 --> 00:03:06.801
What remains unclear
as of this morning

00:03:06.801 --> 00:03:09.801
is if and when they may vote
on what would be

00:03:09.801 --> 00:03:11.300
a historic indictment.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:13.534
-It's possible, we're told,
that they may hear

00:03:13.534 --> 00:03:16.033
from one witness,
at least one witness.

00:03:16.033 --> 00:03:18.033
But all of this is taking place
in secret,

00:03:18.033 --> 00:03:21.367
so we don't have a lot of sense
of what exactly is going on

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:22.567
behind the scenes.

00:03:22.567 --> 00:03:24.868
You know, this process
is normally secretive.

00:03:24.868 --> 00:03:26.701
This is a normal
course of events,

00:03:26.701 --> 00:03:29.033
but there's just such a big
spotlight on this

00:03:29.033 --> 00:03:31.434
as we wait to see whether
District Attorney Alvin Bragg

00:03:31.434 --> 00:03:33.434
will move forward
and ask this grand jury

00:03:33.434 --> 00:03:34.934
to indict the former president.

00:03:34.934 --> 00:03:36.767
-Look, I'm not a prosecutor,

00:03:36.767 --> 00:03:39.100
but how many more witnesses
do they need to hear from?

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:41.367
Are they also interviewing
the groundskeeper

00:03:41.367 --> 00:03:43.367
