and Stormy met?

00:03:43.367 --> 00:03:45.868
"Uh, yeah, I was reseeding
the grass on the ninth hole

00:03:45.868 --> 00:03:48.367
when, uh, Mr. Trump came over,
dropped his ball in the cup,

00:03:48.367 --> 00:03:50.701
screamed 'That's a hole-in-one!'
then he winked at me and said,

00:03:50.701 --> 00:03:52.200
'Let's keep this
between us, Rusty.'"

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:53.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:53.601 --> 00:03:55.767
"Uh, which I should note,
is not my name.

00:03:55.767 --> 00:03:58.467
Then his phone rang
and he said, 'I gotta take this.

00:03:58.467 --> 00:04:00.701
It's an adult film star
I'm gonna go have sex with.'"

00:04:00.701 --> 00:04:02.200
[ Laughter ]

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.701
As far as criminal cases go,
this one seems

00:04:03.701 --> 00:04:04.767
pretty open and shut to me.

00:04:04.767 --> 00:04:06.734
We have testimony
from Trump's ex-fixer,

00:04:06.734 --> 00:04:08.567
who already went to jail
for the same crime.

00:04:08.567 --> 00:04:10.901
We have a physical copy
of the check itself,

00:04:10.901 --> 00:04:13.234
which we know is Trump's because
it has that signature on it

00:04:13.234 --> 00:04:16.400
that looks like he's drawing
on the deck of a fishing trawler

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:17.734
trapped in a hurricane.

00:04:17.734 --> 00:04:19.400
[ Laughter ]

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.901
"This is what the waves
look like!"

00:04:21.901 --> 00:04:23.400
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:26.467
Trump's signature looks
like they did an EKG

00:04:26.467 --> 00:04:29.300
while he was having sex
with Stormy Daniels.

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:30.968
