00:05:54.267 --> 00:05:56.834
And hey, maybe Trump doesn't
think that should be illegal,

00:05:56.834 --> 00:05:58.567
but it is.
He was president for four years.

00:05:58.567 --> 00:05:59.667
He should have
changed the law.

00:05:59.667 --> 00:06:01.200
Instead of talking
about his dumb wall

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:03.400
