00:09:26.133 --> 00:09:27.567
[Normal voice]
Now, Trump, predictably,

00:09:27.567 --> 00:09:29.334
has been doing his usual thing
where he panics

00:09:29.334 --> 00:09:31.033
and throws a bunch of nonsense
against the wall

00:09:31.033 --> 00:09:32.434
just to see what sticks.

00:09:32.434 --> 00:09:34.767
For example, at a rally
in Texas this weekend,

00:09:34.767 --> 00:09:37.734
he blasted prosecutors for using
his former fixer, Michael Cohen,

00:09:37.734 --> 00:09:39.634
who made the payment
to Stormy Daniels,

00:09:39.634 --> 00:09:40.968
as a key witness.

00:09:40.968 --> 00:09:43.000
-They took the word
of a proven liar...

00:09:44.634 --> 00:09:47.901
...a convicted felon
and a disbarred lawyer.

00:09:47.901 --> 00:09:49.901
All the same person,
believe it or not.

00:09:49.901 --> 00:09:51.234
[ Laughter ]

00:09:51.234 --> 00:09:53.067
You wouldn't think
that could go to one person.

00:09:53.067 --> 00:09:54.868
It would be three, four, five.

00:09:54.868 --> 00:09:57.367
-First of all,
he almost sounds jealous.

00:09:57.367 --> 00:09:59.868
[ Laughter ]

00:09:59.868 --> 00:10:02.167
Proven liar, convicted felon,
disbarred lawyer --

00:10:02.167 --> 00:10:04.167
as they call it,
the Trump Triple Crown.

00:10:04.167 --> 00:10:05.400
[ Laughter ]

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:07.234
And yeah, he's a convicted felon
because of you.

00:10:07.234 --> 00:10:09.467
The lies he told and the
felonies committed were for you.

00:10:09.467 --> 00:10:11.834
He got convicted for making
the hush-money payment,

00:10:11.834 --> 00:10:13.901
the thing you're
being investigated for.

00:10:13.901 --> 00:10:15.434
You don't get to use that
against him now.

00:10:15.434 --> 00:10:16.601
Next thing we know,

00:10:16.601 --> 00:10:18.167
Trump's gonna start
attacking Mike Pence

00:10:18.167 --> 00:10:19.501
for being his vice president.

00:10:19.501 --> 00:10:20.767
[As Trump]
You can't trust that guy.

00:10:20.767 --> 00:10:23.501
He worked for me,
and I'm a real son of a bitch.

00:10:23.501 --> 00:10:25.167
[Normal voice] At the same rally
over the weekend,

00:10:25.167 --> 00:10:26.834
Trump also lied
and claimed prosecutors

00:10:26.834 --> 00:10:28.868
resigned
from the Manhattan DA's Office

00:10:28.868 --> 00:10:30.534
because they opposed
the Trump investigation,

00:10:30.534 --> 00:10:31.567
which is not true.

00:10:31.567 --> 00:10:33.234
In reality,
prosecutors resigned

00:10:33.234 --> 00:10:35.434
because they felt the DA
was not moving forward

00:10:35.434 --> 00:10:37.000
with criminal charges
fast enough.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:39.868
-They even had numerous
prosecutors who resigned

00:10:39.868 --> 00:10:41.834
because I was being
treated unfairly.

00:10:41.834 --> 00:10:43.701
That made me feel so good
when I heard that.

00:10:43.701 --> 00:10:46.701
Think of it, people actually
in a Democrat area,

00:10:46.701 --> 00:10:48.334
a Democrat office,
they resigned.

00:10:48.334 --> 00:10:50.167
Did you know that?
They resigned.

00:10:50.167 --> 00:10:51.934
A lot of them
resigned the office

00:10:51.934 --> 00:10:54.067
because they said, "You can't
treat a man like this.

00:10:54.067 --> 00:10:56.000
He didn't do anything wrong."

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:58.000
-That is definitely not
what they said.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:59.334
[ Laughter ]

00:10:59.334 --> 00:11:01.501
Trump just makes up
fake dialogue

00:11:01.501 --> 00:11:03.067
like a middle school
drama teacher

00:11:03.067 --> 00:11:06.267
who couldn't get the rights
to "To Kill a Mockingbird."

00:11:06.267 --> 00:11:07.868
Alright, the play
we're gonna be doing today

00:11:07.868 --> 00:11:09.200
is an original piece I wrote

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:11.200
called "To Wound a Toucan."

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:12.701
[ Laughter ]

00:11:12.701 --> 00:11:14.434
The climactic scene
comes at the end

00:11:14.434 --> 00:11:17.300
when a lawyer named Amicus Funk
and his daughter Scoot --

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:19.968
it's very important

00:11:19.968 --> 00:11:21.634
we call her Scoot --

00:11:21.634 --> 00:11:23.734
[ Laughter ]

00:11:23.734 --> 00:11:26.734
...befriend the neighborhood
recluse named Bruce Ripley.

00:11:26.734 --> 00:11:29.667
And when the sheriff
confronts old Bruce,

00:11:29.667 --> 00:11:31.734
they tell the sheriff, "You
can't treat a man like this.

00:11:31.734 --> 00:11:34.234
He didn't do anything wrong!"

00:11:34.234 --> 00:11:36.033
Then Bruce pays off a porn star.

00:11:36.033 --> 00:11:37.367
[ Laughter ]

00:11:37.367 --> 00:11:39.000
It also won't surprise you
to learn that Trump

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:41.067
has been trying to menace
everyone into backing down

00:11:41.067 --> 00:11:42.334
by essentially
threatening violence.

00:11:42.334 --> 00:11:44.000
On Friday, he warned
that there would be, quote,

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:45.534
"death and destruction"
if he was indicted,

00:11:45.534 --> 00:11:47.067
which is dangerous
and unhinged, of course,

00:11:47.067 --> 00:11:48.634
but also, I'm not so sure,

00:11:48.634 --> 00:11:51.234
because when Trump first claimed
he was about to be arrested

00:11:51.234 --> 00:11:53.467
and told his supporters to take
to the streets in his defense,

00:11:53.467 --> 00:11:55.701
the turnout was --
well, it was underwhelming.

00:11:55.701 --> 00:11:59.100
-Despite Trump's calls
on social media to protest,

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:00.701
demonstrations across New York

00:12:00.701 --> 00:12:03.634
barely brought out 100 people,
and crowds dissipated

00:12:03.634 --> 00:12:04.901
as the day went on.

00:12:04.901 --> 00:12:06.434
-Take a live look behind me
right now.

00:12:06.434 --> 00:12:08.434
You can see a handful
of supporters are here

00:12:08.434 --> 00:12:10.767
on behalf of former
President Trump.

00:12:10.767 --> 00:12:12.100
-I'm sorry,
those aren't protests.

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:14.434
Those are tourists.

00:12:14.434 --> 00:12:15.934
It's midtown Manhattan.

00:12:15.934 --> 00:12:18.767
I've seen bachelorette parties
larger than that.

00:12:18.767 --> 00:12:20.601
And louder than that.

00:12:20.601 --> 00:12:24.234
You know, some people
live in this city, ladies!

00:12:24.234 --> 00:12:25.801
[ Laughter ]

00:12:25.801 --> 00:12:27.634
Seriously, it doesn't
count as a protest

00:12:27.634 --> 00:12:30.300
if you're outnumbered
by the Times Square Elmos.

00:12:30.300 --> 00:12:31.968
[ Laughter ]

00:12:33.567 --> 00:12:35.367
So, we don't know
what's gonna happen,

00:12:35.367 --> 00:12:37.367
but I'll tell you one thing
we do know for sure.

00:12:37.367 --> 00:12:39.701
The only source of information
we definitely can't trust

00:12:39.701 --> 00:12:41.033
is Donald Trump himself.

00:12:41.033 --> 00:12:42.701
First, he said he was gonna be
arrested last Tuesday,

00:12:42.701 --> 00:12:44.067
which didn't happen.

00:12:44.067 --> 00:12:45.934
Now he's apparently claiming
the case has been dropped.

00:12:45.934 --> 00:12:47.467
-We got new information
this morning

00:12:47.467 --> 00:12:51.400
from our Washington bureau on
the plane with Trump last night.

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:54.000
Asked about the Manhattan
DA's investigation,

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.200
he said, "I think they've
already dropped the case.

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:58.567
From what I understand,
I think it's been dropped.

00:12:58.567 --> 00:13:01.634
But I believe that if anything
ever happened with the case,

00:13:01.634 --> 00:13:04.667
it's a fake case.
It's just a fake case."

00:13:04.667 --> 00:13:06.367
-So, in one week,
he went from saying

00:13:06.367 --> 00:13:08.033
he's about to be arrested
to telling his supporters

00:13:08.033 --> 00:13:09.267
to take to the streets,

00:13:09.267 --> 00:13:10.601
threatening death
and destruction,

00:13:10.601 --> 00:13:11.934
to saying the case
has been dropped.

00:13:11.934 --> 00:13:13.701
He talks about getting arrested
like he's choosing

00:13:13.701 --> 00:13:15.701
between chicken and fish
at a wedding.

00:13:15.701 --> 00:13:17.200
"I'll have the chick--
No, wait.

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:19.467
I'll have the fi-- Never mind.
I'll have the chicken.

00:13:19.467 --> 00:13:21.334
If I have the fish,
there's gonna be some death

00:13:21.334 --> 00:13:23.501
and destruction in the bathroom,

00:13:23.501 --> 00:13:24.834
if you know what I mean.

00:13:24.834 --> 00:13:28.501
You all -- You all knew
exactly what I meant.

00:13:28.501 --> 00:13:29.968
I shouldn't have -- Okay.

00:13:29.968 --> 00:13:32.067
And of course, it's not just
Trump who's been freaking out,

00:13:32.067 --> 00:13:33.701
but his toadies
over on Fox News --

00:13:33.701 --> 00:13:35.767
you know, the same network
where all the hosts

00:13:35.767 --> 00:13:38.734
were texting behind his back
about how much he sucks.

00:13:38.734 --> 00:13:41.400
Well, they spent
the last week

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:43.501
pretending to be mad
about the possibility

00:13:43.501 --> 00:13:46.100
that Trump might finally be
held accountable for his crimes.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:48.634
-They'd better not put
my president in prison.

00:13:48.634 --> 00:13:52.734
He represents
74 million Americans,

00:13:52.734 --> 00:13:54.367
and if he's the nominee,

00:13:54.367 --> 00:13:58.133
you're putting 74 million votes
in prison.

00:13:58.133 --> 00:13:59.300
-Settlements like this,

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:01.133
whatever you think of them,
are common,

00:14:01.133 --> 00:14:03.367
both among famous people,
celebrities,

00:14:03.367 --> 00:14:04.934
and in corporate America.

00:14:04.934 --> 00:14:07.033
The result is usually known
as an NDA,

00:14:07.033 --> 00:14:10.033
a non-disclosure agreement.
In this case,

00:14:10.033 --> 00:14:12.033
you can believe whatever side
you want to believe.

00:14:12.033 --> 00:14:14.367
But paying people
not to talk about things,

00:14:14.367 --> 00:14:17.968
hush money, is ordinary
in modern America.

00:14:17.968 --> 00:14:22.334
-Well, you know, years back,
famously, or infamously,

00:14:22.334 --> 00:14:24.200
a well-known
New York judge said

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:27.200
in New York,
you can indict a ham sandwich.

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:29.234
So that's what Alvin Bragg
may be doing.

00:14:29.234 --> 00:14:30.968
He may be indicting
a ham sandwich.

00:14:30.968 --> 00:14:33.000
-Well, especially if
the ham sandwich is named Trump.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:35.968
-You know, in every other
parallel universe but this one,

00:14:35.968 --> 00:14:38.267
Donald Trump's nickname
is Ham Sandwich.

00:14:38.267 --> 00:14:39.634
[ Laughter ]

00:14:39.634 --> 00:14:42.067
This is the only timeline
where he made a billion dollars

00:14:42.067 --> 00:14:44.934
and got elected president.
Everywhere else in the cosmos,

00:14:44.934 --> 00:14:46.634
Trump's walking around Queens
with a broom,

00:14:46.634 --> 00:14:49.801
offering to sweep your sidewalk
for loose change

00:14:49.801 --> 00:14:52.534
while people mutter,
"Oh, look at that ham sandwich."

00:14:52.534 --> 00:14:54.267
[ Laughter ]

00:14:54.267 --> 00:14:55.934
"It's just sad."

00:14:56.667 --> 00:14:58.400
Again, we have no idea
what's gonna happen.

00:14:58.400 --> 00:15:00.868
But if we're gonna call
ourselves a genuine democracy

00:15:00.868 --> 00:15:02.534
that actually respects
the rule of law,

00:15:02.534 --> 00:15:03.834
then it's obvious
that Trump should be

00:15:03.834 --> 00:15:05.067
held accountable for his crimes.

00:15:05.067 --> 00:15:07.634
It would be nice if,
in addition to this crime,

00:15:07.634 --> 00:15:09.501
he was also held accountable
for the coup attempt

00:15:09.501 --> 00:15:10.934
or any of his other crimes.

00:15:10.934 --> 00:15:12.834
I don't know how many there are,
but if you ask Rudy,

00:15:12.834 --> 00:15:14.033
it's probably
in the ballpark of...

00:15:14.033 --> 00:15:15.167
-130,000?

00:15:15.167 --> 00:15:17.467
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:15:17.467 --> 00:15:19.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:15:19.267 --> 00:15:21.634
♪♪

